            "review_title": "Review at Furyu Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Lam T\n1 contribution\n0\nCosy atmosphere, high quality food\nNov 2017 • Family\nThe cosy, pleasant atmosphere at Furyu make it so suitable for family gatherings at weekend. Highly recommended!!\nI am addicted to Cheese Ton Ton Furai and KaKi Poteto Furai (deep fried food), with the fresh salads at Furyu.\nThe servers are nice and friendly.\nGive Furyu a try, guys!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 17, 2017",
